# Everything any target in Makefile/tools/orgapi/Makefile/tools/orgviewer/Makefile writes back
# into the working tree under RUN_IN_DOCKER=0 (Terraform plan/data cache, pytest cache, the
# orgviewer build) -- see each Makefile's DIST_DIR. RUN_IN_DOCKER=1 (the default) never creates
# these at all; each target's output lives in a named Docker volume instead.
/.dist/
tools/orgapi/.dist/
tools/orgviewer/.dist/

# Terraform's own local module/plugin cache, in case `terraform init` is ever run directly
# instead of through Make (which redirects it into .dist/ above).
org-model/.terraform/
examples/*/.terraform/
tools/orgapi/tests/fixtures/orgdata/.terraform/

# orgapi (tools/orgapi/) -- Python venv, recreated by `uv sync`.
tools/orgapi/.venv/
**/__pycache__/

*.orig

ai-dlc/
aidlc-docs/
.aidlc/
.aidlc-rule-details/
